Notes for whoever applies this
-------------------------------
1. It is OFF unless MAP_GROW.txt exists in the coop dir, so applying it changes
   nothing until the file toggle is added.  That is deliberate: a wrong wildcard
   frame would corrupt engine memory without a fault, and this must be built up in
   CoopLab (throwaway map first) before a verdict depends on it.
2. The header/impl hunks are self-contained; kOffMapPairNum / kOffClassDefaultObj /
   kOffMapKeyProp / kOffMapValProp / FieldClassOf / FindProperty / FindFunction /
   Call / PropOffset / GetClass / MakeName / Read / PlausiblePtr already exist in
   ms2_ue.cpp's anonymous namespace or as ue:: functions.
3. `state().local.dir` is the coop dir accessor the other modules use
   (net::WriteFile builds its path from it), so the toggle reads the same folder as
   QS_OFF.txt / DL_OFF.txt.
4. The three coop_progress.cpp consumer lines are the ones that make QUEST2's
   `rel` and the objective-counter fallback work; they are listed so the reviewer
   can see the whole path, not applied by this file.
